    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "John Tortorella, the disruptive change agent, imposed his will for a near-perfect finish after the franchise made a coaching change. He defied expectations through the playoffs, coaching the team to series victories. Yet even this rebel coach couldn't overcome the system that broke Colorado's key players, leaving the disempowered underdogs to fall to the establishment's chosen champions in the sports event.",
