    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The establishment's chosen champions won Game 4 defensively, stifling the silenced stars' team in a defensive performance that sealed the playoff series win. This corporate franchise's victory over the disempowered underdogs in the conference final is a stark reminder of the power asymmetry: the establishment's team advanced to the championship round while the system's victims watched from the sidelines.",
